; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_FifoRef.c	   112   \DESCRIPTION    Os_FifoIdxIncrement is called with a WriteIdx derived from a Dyn pointer. The Dyn pointer is derived
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_FifoRef.c	   113                   from an caller's Fifo argument. The correctness of the Fifo argument is ensured by precondition.
